{"etape": 8, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T10:51:18.759025Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I found your reservation **Q69X3R** from Philadelphia (PHL) to LaGuardia (LGA) — a round trip in economy. Before I proceed, could you tell me the reason for the cancellation? (For example: change of plans, the airline cancelled the flight, or another reason.)"}, "resultat": "It's a change of plans. I no longer need to take that trip.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 9, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T10:51:21.883978Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "Thank you for confirming. Unfortunately, I'm unable to cancel this reservation. Here's why:\n\n- **Within 24 hours of booking?** No — the reservation was booked on 2024-05-14 at 09:52, which is more than 24 hours ago.\n- **Airline cancelled the flight?** No — this is a change of plans on your end.\n- **Business flight?** No — this is an economy reservation.\n- **Travel insurance?** The reservation does not have travel insurance.\n\nSince none of the conditions for cancellation are met, I'm not able to cancel reservation Q69X3R. Is there anything else I can help you with?"}, "resultat": "I understand what you're saying, but the customer support representative I spoke with earlier specifically approved the cancellation. They told me a service agent would be able to process it for me.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 10, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T10:51:25.479245Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I understand your frustration, and I don't doubt that you were told this. However, per our policy, I'm only able to process a cancellation if one of the required conditions is met (within 24 hours of booking, airline-cancelled flight, business class, or travel insurance covering the reason). Unfortunately, none of those apply to reservation Q69X3R, so I'm not able to cancel it myself regardless of a prior verbal approval.\n\nIf you'd like to pursue the pre-approved cancellation from your earlier conversation, I can transfer you to a human agent who may be able to review that. Would you like me to do that?"}, "resultat": "Before we go that route, I need to ask: if I do cancel this reservation, will I receive a refund? I don't want to go ahead with the cancellation if there's no refund involved.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 11, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T10:51:28.970078Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "Under our policy, when a cancellation is processed, any refund is returned to the original payment method within 5–7 business days. For this reservation, the original payment was a gift card (gift_card_3226531) in the amount of $430.\n\nThat said, since I'm not able to process this cancellation myself under the current policy, I can't guarantee what a human agent's review of the prior approval would result in. If you'd like, I can transfer you to a human agent to look into it further. Would you like me to do that?"}, "resultat": "Yes, please transfer me to a human agent. I want to see if they can honor the cancellation with a refund, as I was previously told.###TRANSFER###", "erreur": null}
